# CHAT-COMPRESSOR (session memory)

Compressed Agent Chat memory lives under `~/.cursor/context-graphs/` (override with `CHAT_COMPRESSOR_STATE_DIR` in `~/.cursor/chat-compressor.env`).

When session context includes `HOT_SET`, `FORWARD_GIST`, or `STATE` lines from the compressor:

- Prefer HOT_SET / extractive FORWARD_GIST over restating the full conversation.
- Treat the forward payload as compact memory, not a transcript dump (Pattern-1 vocab decode is debug-only unless `CHAT_COMPRESSOR_INJECT_P1=1`).
- Do not invent stronger claims than the injected context supports.

Hooks run outside the model path (model-agnostic). They never require `CURSOR_API_KEY`.
